git-svn-id: https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/hadoop/common/trunk@1379100 13f79535-47bb-0310-9956-ffa450edef68

Here is the root cause:
The root cause of the bug was that the secrets contained in the `Credentials` were not being properly made available to the MapReduce tasks. This was due to the incorrect use of the method `addTokensToUGI`, which did not effectively add the required credentials to the `UserGroupInformation` (UGI) of the user executing the tasks. Consequently, the tasks lacked the necessary tokens and secrets to authorize access to secured resources.

Here is the patch:
